msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>Unesite metodu zaokruživanja koja se koristi za ovu valutu.  Pogledajte <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Što je ovo</span> za više detalja.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox, comboRoundingMethod)
#: kmymoney/dialogs/kcurrencyeditordlg.ui:128
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">RoundNever</span></"
"p><p>Don't do any rounding, simply truncate and print a warning in case of a "
"remainder. Otherwise the same as RoundTrunc.</p><p><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">RoundFloor</span></p><p>Round to the largest integral value "
"not greater than the value. E.g. 0.5 -&gt; 0.0 and -0.5 -&gt; -1.0</"
"p><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">RoundCeil</span></p><p>Round to the "
"smallest integral value not less than the value. E.g. 0.5 -&gt; 1.0 and -0.5 "
"-&gt; -0.0</p><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">RoundTruncate</span></"
"p><p>No rounding, simply truncate any fraction</p><p><span style=\" font-"
"weight:600;\">RoundPromote</span></p><p>Use RoundCeil for positive and "
"RoundFloor for negative values. E.g. 0.5 -&gt; 1.0 and -0.5 -&gt; -1.0</"
"p><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">RoundHalfDown</span></p><p>Round up "
"or down with the following constraints: 0.1 .. 0.5 -&gt; 0.0 and 0.6 .. 0.9 -"
"&gt; 1.0</p><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">RoundHalfUp</span></"
"p><p>Round up or down with the following constraints: 0.1 .. 0.4 -&gt; 0.0 "
"and 0.5 .. 0.9 -&gt; 1.0</p><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">RoundRound</"
"span></p><p>Use RoundHalfDown for 0.1 .. 0.4 and RoundHalfUp for 0.6 .. 0.9. "
"Use RoundHalfUp for 0.5 in case the resulting numerator is odd, "
"RoundHalfDown in case the resulting numerator is even. E.g. 0.5 -&gt; 0.0 "
"and 1.5 -&gt; 2.0</p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">RoundNever</span></p><p>Nemojte zaokruživati, jednostavno skratite i ispišite upozorenje u slučaju ostatka. U suprotnom isto kao i RoundTrunc.</p><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">RoundFloor</span></p><p>Zaokruži na najveću integralnu vrijednost koja nije veća od vrijednosti. npr. 0,5 -&gt; 0,0 i -0,5 -&gt; -1.0</p><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">RoundCeil</span></p><p>Zaokruži na najmanju integralnu vrijednost koja nije manja od vrijednosti. npr. 0,5 -&gt; 1,0 i -0,5 -&gt; -0.0</p><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">RoundTruncate</span></p><p>Bez zaokruživanja, jednostavno skratite sve fraction</p><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">RoundPromote</span></p><p>Koristite RoundCeil za pozitivne i RoundFloor za negativne vrijednosti. npr. 0,5 -&gt; 1,0 i -0,5 -&gt; -1.0</p><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">RoundHalfDown</span></p><p>Zaokruži gore ili dolje sa sljedećim ograničenjima: 0.1 .. 0.5 -&gt; 0,0 i 0,6 .. 0,9 -&gt; 1.0</p><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">RoundHalfUp</span></p><p>Zaokruži gore ili dolje sa sljedećim ograničenjima: 0.1 .. 0.4 -&gt; 0,0 i 0,5 .. 0,9 -&gt; 1.0</p><p><span style=\" font-weight:600;\">RoundRound</span></p><p>Koristite RoundHalfDown za 0.1 .. 0.4 i RoundHalfUp za 0.6 .. 0.9. Koristite RoundHalfUp za 0,5 u slučaju da je rezultirajući brojnik neparan, RoundHalfDown u slučaju da je rezultirajući brojnik paran. npr. 0,5 -&gt; 0,0 i 1,5 -&gt; 2.0</p></body></html>"

