#, kde-format
msgid "New Loan Account Wizard"
msgstr "Čarobnjak za novi račun zajma"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, TextLabel1_2)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newloanwizard/newintrowizardpage.ui:77
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Welcome to the New Loan Account Wizard which will guide you through the "
"creation of a new loan e.g. for your home, your car or any other loan that "
"you pay or gain interest for.\n"
"\n"
"Please make sure that you have the relevant information handy. You usually "
"get the information out of your contract and the last statement."
msgstr "\nDobro došli u čarobnjaka za novi kreditni račun koji će vas voditi kroz kreiranje novog kredita, npr. za vaš dom, vaš automobil ili bilo koji drugi zajam koji plaćate ili za koji dobivate kamate.\n\nMolimo provjerite imate li relevantne informacije pri ruci. Informacije obično dobijete iz svog ugovora i posljednjeg bankovnog izvoda."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, TextLabel19_2)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newloanwizard/newpaymentswizardpage.ui:19
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"In the following steps, KMyMoney supports you in setting up categories and "
"schedules for your loan payments."
msgstr "\nIU sljedećim koracima, KMyMoney vas podržava u postavljanju kategorija i rasporeda za plaćanja vašeg kredita."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, TextLabel16_2)
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, TextLabel8_2_2)
#: kmymoney/wizards/newloanwizard/paymenteditwizardpage.ui:19
#: kmymoney/wizards/newloanwizard/paymentwizardpage.ui:19
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Please enter the amount you pay for principal and interest or leave the "
"field empty to calculate it."
msgstr "\n Molimo unesite iznos koji plaćate za glavnicu i kamate ili ostavite polje prazno da biste ga izračunali."

