#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Note: Payments made to obtain the loan (e.g. Dissagio) are not considered as "
"payments in this context."
msgstr "Napomena: Uplate za dobivanje zajma (npr. Dissagio) ne smatraju se plaćanjima u ovom kontekstu."

